&lt;h3&gt;Enhancements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Add &lt;code&gt;Window.WindowDecorationsTheme&lt;/code&gt; property by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4187090855" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21061" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21061/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21061"&gt;#21061&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core – Clarify that &lt;code&gt;ElementRole&lt;/code&gt; is dependent on &lt;code&gt;ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint&lt;/code&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/MrJul/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/MrJul"&gt;@MrJul&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4310263363" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/issues/21243" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21243/hovercard" href="https://github.com/AvaloniaUI/Avalonia/pull/21243"&gt;#21243&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
